*> Reachability through fall-through, PERFORM, PERFORM THRU, and GO TO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    PERFORM INIT
    PERFORM STEP-1 THRU STEP-EXIT
    IF ERRORS > 0
        GO TO ABEND
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
INIT.
    MOVE 0 TO ERRORS.
STEP-1.
    ADD 1 TO COUNTER.
STEP-2.
    ADD 2 TO COUNTER.
STEP-EXIT.
    EXIT.
AFTER-RANGE.
    DISPLAY "ONLY REACHED IF SOMETHING FALLS OR JUMPS HERE".
ABEND.
    DISPLAY "FAILED"
    GOBACK.
NEVER-CALLED.
    DISPLAY "DEAD CODE".
